<font size="+2" color="#0000FF">Irregular　Girl(s)</font><br>
<hr>
<table border="0" width="100%">
<tr>
<td  bgcolor="#00FFCC"><strong><a href="http://www14.big.or.jp/~yays/library/novel/200104/23004330/irregular_girl.html" target="_blank">第1話を読むにはココをクリック</a></strong>  <i>2001/04/23 01:01:57</i><br></td>
<td bgcolor="#00CCFF" width="10%" align="center" nowrap>
